flowchart TB
  S["New sensor sample"] --> V{"Valid and ready?"}
  V -->|No| F["Fault transition; preserve active alert"]
  V -->|Yes| A{"Alert already active?"}
  A -->|No| H{"Above high for three samples?"}
  H -->|Yes| ON["Activate once; record event and alert"]
  H -->|No| WAIT["Wait; reset count if condition breaks"]
  A -->|Yes| L{"Below clear for three samples?"}
  L -->|Yes| OFF["Clear once; retain history"]
  L -->|No| KEEP["Preserve active alert"]
